                                "sense_id": "9a6cf725-358b-377e-97f0-be697fcab6d1",
                                "text": "Ze vonden een oude dieptebom op de zeebodem.",
                                "translation": "They found an old depth charge on the sea floor.",
                                "english": "They found an old depth charge on the sea floor."
                            },
                            {
